            <ArticleTitle>An assessment of asthma needs in Hawaii.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>68, 70-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Hawaii State Asthma Control Program, as a part of state planning, disseminated and collected an asthma needs questionnaire aimed at answering this question: &quot;In your opinion, what asthma-related issues need to be better addressed in Hawaii?&quot; The top five areas of need identified by asthma stakeholders were (1) education, (2) disease management, (3) prevention, (4) healthcare, and (5) support.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
